ce | Research |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 13:30 | Andrea Lazaro Garcia | Yasmine Kabbaj v Andrea Lazaro Garcia (Vanda Pharmaceuticals Mallorca Women's Championships presented by Ecotrans Group Round 1) | 1.38 est. | 73% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Yasmine+Kabbaj+vs+Andrea+Lazaro+Garcia+prediction+12+October+2026) |\n| 14:00 | Struga | Bashkimi Kumanovo v Struga (First League) | 1.13 | 78% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Bashkimi+Kumanovo+vs+Struga+prediction+12+October+2026) |\n| 18:00 | Forge | Forge v York United (Canadian Premier League) | 1.36 | 74% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Forge+vs+York+United+prediction+12+October+2026) |\n| 22:15 | Always Ready | Always Ready v Independiente Petrolero (División Profesional) | 1.10 | 76% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Always+Ready+vs+Independiente+Petrolero+prediction+12+October+2026) |\n| 23:20 | Nacional Asunción | Nacional Asunción v Deportivo Recoleta (División Profesional) | 1.75 | 77% | [Google](https://www.google.com/search?q=Nacional+Asunci%C3%B3n+vs+Deportivo+Recoleta+prediction+12+October+2026) |\n\nModel probabilities are footyalmanac's own; our backtest says bookmakers still price football slightly better than the model, so treat these as informed suggestions, not value bets. Accumulators multiply the bookmaker margin. Not betting advice."
